      q: "\"A recent High Court judgement has sought to dispel the idea of begging as a disease - which leads to its stigmatization and criminalization - and to regard it as a symptom. The underlying disease is the failure of the state to protect citizens who fall through the social security net.\" Which one of the following statements can be inferred from the given passage?",
